Why not ??? There are even SEVERAL Intel compilers resp. special
function libraries I know of where you need to have a *runtime* license
for *every* system you will run the resulting binary on, clearly no
matter if you link it dynamically or statically.
 
Regarding DEC DU I fear it is also so from what I heard here, but I
don't personally use it and don't have the license text available.

