BTW, how do you use Linux/DU on an *embedded* system ??? There is the
ELKS project (Embedded Linux Kernel Subset), but this is still far from
anything useful, and also there, what they did lately, runs in RAM and
from a harddisk, still not at all from ROM. There were even many
discussions on the mailing list if probably the E from embedded should
be dropped therefor.


