A 233 Alpha running RH 5.1 next to a 233 AMD K5 running RH 5. I take
part in the distributed.net effort. The K6 crunches about 3 times as
many keys/sec as the Alpha does in the RC5 contest. The DES-II contest
was a different story. The Alpha was just over twice as fast as the
AMD. Both are faster than a Sun Ultra 1/140 in this particular
application.

