Subject: The AS 4/233 ARC console solution  & is there a FAQ?
Date: 1998/07/23
Message-ID: <35B73A85.B3B6F128@apk.net>#1/1
X-Deja-AN: 374171680
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 7bit
Organization: APK Net, Ltd.
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=us-ascii
Mime-Version: 1.0
Newsgroups: comp.os.linux.alpha

Go to  ftp://ftp.digital.com/pub/DEC/Alpha/firmware/utilities
Grab mkboot.exe

Go to ftp://ftp.digital.com/pub/DEC/Alpha/firmware/readmes/alpha200.html

Grap as200_v6_7.exe

On a DOS or WINx PC, put them in the same directory and
C:\> mkboot as200_~1.exe a:\fwupdate.exe

At the src prompt enter

>>>b -fl 0,a0 dva0

That's is a lower case L after the dash f.

For more info punch in:
http://www.mindspring.com/~ccsf-lug/AS200.htm
http://www.toast.net/~strycher/AS200.html

Is there a  FAQ?


