> performance?  What kind of memory do I need?  I've got some
> 16 MB 60ns 72-pin non-parity SIMMs.  Will these work?

Yes, adding memory will help keep you out of swap; if you're swapping, the
memory will speed things up.  If not, it won't.  The memory you've listed
will *not* work in your Alpha; Alphaboxes need true-parity memory.  BTW, I
have the same system (almost identical config) with 64M memory.

