I had a system with precisely the same configuration. (I have since
added a PCI NE2000 ethercard, and more memory. But I ran mine for a
while set up exactly as you describe above, so there's nothing about
that configuration, in and of itself, that's broken.) The shop manual
for the Noname mobo says that the 3.3v power is only needed if you
