Jean-Francois LAHIER (jean-francois.lahier@cardian.com) wrote:
: Hi,

: I finally managed to install RH 5.1 on my DEC 433au AlphaStation.
: the only problem I have left (so far) is that my network card
: (DEC DC21142 tulip chip) cannot see the network. I had the same

see the linux tulip mailing list archives (linked from
 http://cesdis.gsfc.nasa.gov/linux/drivers/tulip.html).

We had to do this to get a link:

replace
{ PCI_DEVICE_ID_DEC_TULIP_21142, "Digital DS21142/3 Tulip", 256, 0x0801fbff,
        HAS_MII | HAS_MEDIA_TABLE, t21142_timer }
in tulip.c
with
{ PCI_DEVICE_ID_DEC_TULIP_21142, "Digital DS21142/3 Tulip", 256, 0x0801fbff,
        HAS_MII | HAS_MEDIA_TABLE, tulip_timer }
and load the driver as a module with an option specifying the interface type
to use, e.g. options=11

Note that this was on a x86, I have a 21142 card running with 10base2 here
without problems, tulip 0.88

olaf
