Alpha?	I don't like to think of myself as stupid, but I'm beginning to think
that I may have left out something important.  I'll admit that knowing what
the .config file for the out-of-the-box kernel looks like would help, so at
least I'd have some idea as to which options were used to build the kernel I
have that works.  Any guidance you can provide would be of great help.

