SOrry,
You can't do NT & VMS, because NT requires ARC/Alphabios while VMS
requires SRM. Although Linux can do _BOTH_ SRM & ARC ;-)

Therefore you can only have the following combinations:
1. Linux & VMS (using SRM)
2. Linux & NT (using ARC/Alphabios)
3. Linux & DU (using SRM)
4. Linux & DU & VMS (using SRM)

HTH,
Wai-Sun

